Makes 2-3 cups.

Orange Mint Syrup

Per recipe, plus three 5″ sprigs of fresh spearmint. Tear up the mint and add it to the pot about five minutes after the syrup has begun to simmer. Strain out the mint with the orange zest when the syrup is done, at Step 4.

Orange Cardamom Syrup

Per recipe, plus 15 cracked cardamom pods. Add the cardamom to the pot about five minutes after the syrup has begun to simmer. Strain out the cardamom with orange zest when the syrup is done, at Step 4.

Orange Elderflower Syrup

Per recipe, plus 3/4 cup dried elderflower blossoms. Add the blossoms to the pot about five minutes after the syrup has begun to simmer. Strain out the blossoms with the orange zest when the syrup is done, at Step 4.